WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Before it meant a building, the
word church meant an assembly:

2
00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.190
people called out.

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.330
In Matthew's Gospel, Jesus tells Peter:
on this rock I will build my assembly.

4
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.910
But who speaks for that assembly today?

5
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.420
And who decides what the Bible means?

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.900
So where is the true Church?

7
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.330
Wherever the bishops are, or wherever
the gospel is truly preached?

8
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:28.440
In this mission, you'll see how Christians
weigh the Bible against the teaching

9
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.730
of the Church.

10
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:34.890
Then you'll go back to Worms in 1521,
where Martin Luther refused to take back

11
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.260
his writings.

12
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:40.420
Your mission: find out where Christians
have looked for the true Church,

13
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.800
and what is at stake.
